LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:Mindful Mondays
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum and mentally prepare for the week by ma
 king art or journaling\, and make some time to check in with yourself!  J
 oin us for a therapist-selected art activity meant to help you feel more 
 balanced and in control. No priors skills needed\, just bring your heart 
 and mind!  This group meets every Monday from 2–3 p.m.\, excluding holi
 days and museum closures. Meetings are held in the Atrium of the Sidney a
 nd Lois Eskenazi Museum of Art. Food and beverages are permitted in the a
 trium\, so participants are welcome to bring lunch.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us at the museum and mentally prep
 are for the week by making art or journaling\, and make some time to chec
 k in with yourself!</p><p>  Join us for a therapist-selected art activity
  meant to help you feel more balanced and in control. No priors skills ne
 eded\, just bring your heart and mind!</p><p>  This group meets every Mon
 day from 2–3 p.m.\, excluding holidays and museum closures. Meetings ar
 e held in the Atrium of the <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-under
 line inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal
 ">Sidney and Lois Eskenazi Museum of Art</span></span>. Food and beverage
 s are permitted in the atrium\, so participants are welcome to bring lunc
 h.</p>
